B.abW=s(["D\xe9lai d\u2019approbation : {sec}s","Rete pou valide : {sec}s","Time left to approve: {sec}s","Tiempo para aprobar: {sec}s"],t.s)
B.ack=s(["Consultez l\u2019\xe9cran de votre t\xe9l\xe9phone pour saisir votre code secret MonCash.","Gade sou ekran telef\xf2n ou pou w mete k\xf2d sekr\xe8 MonCash ou.","Check your phone screen to enter your MonCash secret PIN.","Mira la pantalla de tu tel\xe9fono para ingresar tu PIN de MonCash."],t.s)
